{"seq":3,"slug":"feedback-systems","title":"高一通用技术 — 反馈系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/systems-control/feedback-systems","wordCount":2296,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一通用技术-反馈系统\">高一通用技术 — 反馈系统</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>你在淋浴时调节水温的动作，就是一个反馈过程：手感觉水太烫（检测），大脑判断需要降温（决策），手旋转旋钮增加冷水比例（执行），然后再次感受温度是否合适（再检测）。这个&quot;检测→比较→调节→再检测&quot;的循环，就是反馈的本质。</p>\n<p>反馈是将系统输出信息返回到输入端，与设定值进行比较，从而影响系统后续行为的过程。它是闭环控制系统的灵魂——没有反馈，闭环就退化为开环。</p>\n<p>反馈的两种基本类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>作用方向</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>负反馈</td>\n<td>反馈信号抵消偏差</td>\n<td>稳定系统，减小偏差</td>\n<td>恒温器、稳压电源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正反馈</td>\n<td>反馈信号增大偏差</td>\n<td>偏离加剧，趋向极端</td>\n<td>麦克风啸叫、核裂变链式反应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在控制工程中，绝大多数应用都使用负反馈，因为我们通常希望系统稳定运行。正反馈虽然在某些场景有用（如振荡器电路需要正反馈来产生持续信号），但如果出现在不应有的地方，往往意味着系统失控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-负反馈的工作机制\">一、负反馈的工作机制</h3><p>负反馈的核心逻辑是&quot;缺了就补，多了就减&quot;。</p>\n<p>以家用冰箱为例：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;设定温度&lt;br&gt;4°C&quot;] --&gt; B((比较器))&#10;    B -- &quot;偏差信号&quot; --&gt; C[温控器]&#10;    C --&gt; D[压缩机]&#10;    D --&gt; E[冰箱内部]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;实际温度&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[温度传感器]&#10;    G -- &quot;反馈信号&quot; --&gt; B\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"设定温度&lt;br&gt;4°C\"] --&gt; B((比较器))\n    B -- \"偏差信号\" --&gt; C[温控器]\n    C --&gt; D[压缩机]\n    D --&gt; E[冰箱内部]\n    E --&gt; F[\"实际温度\"]\n    F --&gt; G[温度传感器]\n    G -- \"反馈信号\" --&gt; B</pre><p>运行过程分析：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>设定温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，冰箱刚开机时内部温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>偏差 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>21</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 - 25 = -21°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">21°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>（负偏差，说明温度偏高）</li>\n<li>温控器启动压缩机制冷</li>\n<li>内部温度逐渐下降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>偏差趋近零，压缩机停止工作</li>\n<li>因外界热量渗入，温度慢慢上升到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>偏差重新出现，压缩机再次启动</li>\n<li>如此循环往复，温度在设定值附近波动</li>\n</ol>\n<p>注意温度不会精确保持在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，而是在一个范围内（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>）波动。这个波动范围称为&quot;控制精度&quot;或&quot;死区&quot;，是实际控制系统的正常现象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-正反馈-失控的循环\">二、正反馈：失控的循环</h3><p>正反馈使偏差越来越大，形成&quot;越来越极端&quot;的循环。</p>\n<p><strong>麦克风啸叫</strong>是最常见的正反馈现象：</p>\n<p>麦克风拾取环境声音 → 扬声器放大播出 → 声音被麦克风再次拾取 → 扬声器更大声播出 → 循环加剧 → 刺耳的啸叫声</p>\n<p><strong>银行挤兑</strong>也是正反馈的社会案例：</p>\n<p>少数人担心银行破产取钱 → 排队取钱的人增加 → 更多人恐慌加入 → 银行真的面临现金不足 → 恐慌进一步蔓延</p>\n<p><strong>正反馈的控制</strong>：在工程中遇到正反馈时，通常需要引入额外的负反馈来抑制。例如演唱会中使用定向麦克风和音箱位置设计来避免啸叫。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-反馈系统的性能指标\">三、反馈系统的性能指标</h3><p>评价一个反馈控制系统的好坏，主要看三个指标：</p>\n<p><strong>稳定性</strong>：系统受到扰动后能否回到平衡状态。就像不倒翁被推一下后能自动恢复，而竖立的铅笔被碰一下就倒了。稳定是控制系统的首要条件——一个不稳定的系统无论精度设计得多高都没有意义。</p>\n<p><strong>准确性</strong>：稳态时输出值与设定值之间的偏差。偏差越小，控制越准确。例如恒温箱设定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>37</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">37°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，实际稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>37.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">37.1°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37.1°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，准确性就比稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>38</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">38°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">38°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的系统好。</p>\n<p><strong>快速性</strong>：系统达到稳态所需的时间。时间越短，响应越快。但过度追求快速性可能导致系统振荡（像急刹车时人在座椅上前后摇晃）。</p>\n<p>这三个指标之间存在矛盾关系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>追求目标</th>\n<th>可能带来的副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>更快响应</td>\n<td>过冲、振荡、不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更高精度</td>\n<td>响应变慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更高稳定性</td>\n<td>响应迟钝、精度下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>控制系统设计的艺术就在于根据具体需求，在三者之间找到最合适的折中方案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-干扰与抗干扰\">四、干扰与抗干扰</h3><p>干扰是影响系统正常运行的外部因素。反馈系统的重要优势之一就是抗干扰能力。</p>\n<p><strong>干扰的分类</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可预见的干扰</strong>：季节变化对空调系统的影响、周期性的负载变化</li>\n<li><strong>随机干扰</strong>：突然开窗导致室温骤变、电网电压波动</li>\n<li><strong>结构性干扰</strong>：传感器老化导致测量偏差、执行机构磨损</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>负反馈如何对抗干扰</strong>：</p>\n<p>假设恒温水槽设定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，突然有人加入一杯冷水（干扰）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>水温从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 骤降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>温度传感器检测到偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60 - 55 = 5°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>控制器加大加热功率</li>\n<li>水温回升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>如果没有反馈（开环），加热器不会知道水温已经降低，也就不会做出补偿</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"五-常见反馈系统实例深度分析\">五、常见反馈系统实例深度分析</h3><p><strong>马桶水箱</strong>——精巧的机械反馈系统：</p>\n<p>冲水后水位下降 → 浮球随水面下降 → 杠杆打开进水阀 → 水流入水箱 → 水位上升 → 浮球上浮 → 杠杆关闭进水阀。整个过程不需要任何电子元件，纯粹依靠浮力和杠杆原理实现自动控制。</p>\n<p><strong>人体体温调节</strong>——自然界的精密反馈系统：</p>\n<p>体温偏高时：皮肤血管扩张 + 出汗散热 → 体温下降\n体温偏低时：皮肤血管收缩 + 肌肉颤抖产热 → 体温上升\n正常体温维持在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36.5°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36.5°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 左右，波动范围仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">±0.5°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，精度远超大多数人工控制系统。</p>\n<p><strong>巡航控制系统</strong>——汽车的速度反馈：</p>\n<p>设定巡航速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 km/h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> → 速度传感器检测实际车速 → 上坡时车速下降 → 控制器增加油门开度 → 车速回升 → 下坡时车速上升 → 控制器减小油门开度或轻微制动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-功能模拟法\">六、功能模拟法</h3><p>功能模拟法是一种利用已知系统的反馈原理来设计新系统的方法。步骤如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>分析参考系统的控制原理和反馈机制</li>\n<li>提取核心控制逻辑</li>\n<li>用新的技术手段实现同样的控制逻辑</li>\n</ol>\n<p>例如：仿照人体瞳孔自动调节光线的机制（光线强 → 瞳孔缩小 → 减少进光量），设计自动调光台灯（光照传感器检测桌面亮度 → 亮度足够则调暗灯光 → 亮度不足则调亮灯光）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>举出日常生活中各一个负反馈和正反馈的例子，画出各自的方框图，并说明它们的效果差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一个恒温控制系统的响应曲线显示：设定温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，系统实际温度先升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，然后降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，再升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>51</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">51°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">51°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，最后稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50.5°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50.5°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。分析这个过程中的过冲现象，并评价该系统的稳定性、准确性和快速性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>自动门系统：红外传感器检测有人接近 → 电机驱动门打开 → 人通过后传感器无检测 → 电机驱动门关闭。请判断这是开环还是闭环控制？画出方框图并说明理由。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个&quot;教室自动通风系统&quot;的方案：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000ppm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 时自动开窗通风。画出系统方框图，标注各环节，并分析可能的干扰因素。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么&quot;温度设定为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的空调实际室温通常在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>～<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>26</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 之间波动&quot;。这种波动能否完全消除？为什么？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>反馈的概念远超工程控制领域。经济学中的&quot;通货膨胀螺旋&quot;是正反馈的表现：物价上涨 → 工人要求涨工资 → 企业成本增加 → 物价进一步上涨。政府的宏观调控政策（如加息）则是引入负反馈来遏制通胀。</p>\n<p>有趣的方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>博弈论中的反馈</strong>：囚徒困境中&quot;以牙还牙&quot;策略就是一种反馈机制——对方合作我也合作，对方背叛我也背叛</li>\n<li><strong>生态平衡</strong>：捕食者与猎物之间的数量波动形成经典的负反馈循环，可用洛特卡-沃尔泰拉方程描述</li>\n<li><strong>控制论之父维纳</strong>的经典著作《控制论》将反馈概念从工程推广到生物学、社会学和哲学，是跨学科思维的典范</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>反馈是闭环控制系统的核心机制。负反馈使系统趋于稳定，是控制工程的基础；正反馈使偏差放大，通常需要加以抑制。评价反馈系统要综合考虑稳定性、准确性和快速性三个相互制约的指标。理解反馈原理不仅有助于分析技术系统，也能帮助你洞察自然界和社会中的许多动态平衡现象。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一通用技术 — 反馈系统","id":"高一通用技术-反馈系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、负反馈的工作机制","id":"一-负反馈的工作机制"},{"level":3,"text":"二、正反馈：失控的循环","id":"二-正反馈-失控的循环"},{"level":3,"text":"三、反馈系统的性能指标","id":"三-反馈系统的性能指标"},{"level":3,"text":"四、干扰与抗干扰","id":"四-干扰与抗干扰"},{"level":3,"text":"五、常见反馈系统实例深度分析","id":"五-常见反馈系统实例深度分析"},{"level":3,"text":"六、功能模拟法","id":"六-功能模拟法"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一通用技术 — 控制基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/systems-control/control-basics"},"next":{"title":"高一通用技术 — 机械结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/tech-applications/mechanical-structure"}}